{"audio":{"src":"https://pub-13abeb101e2945d2a7f60234f6faf52e.r2.dev/materials/a2-welcome-how-our-lessons-work/audio/main-9f2f8f50ff96.mp3","durationSec":183.696,"cues":[{"start":0,"end":1.26,"text":"This is a lesson page."},{"start":1.64,"end":2.64,"text":"It has a lot of words."},{"start":3.18,"end":4.22,"text":"Do you see a hard word?"},{"start":5.04,"end":5.42,"text":"Tap it."},{"start":6.1,"end":7.28,"text":"A small window opens."},{"start":7.94,"end":10.28,"text":"In the window, you see the meaning in easy English."},{"start":10.88,"end":13.5,"text":"You also see the meaning in Japanese and in Spanish."},{"start":14.48,"end":15.14,"text":"Try it now."},{"start":15.9,"end":17.58,"text":"Tap the word window in this sentence."},{"start":18.34,"end":19.78,"text":"You can tap names, too."},{"start":20.56,"end":22.4,"text":"Then close the window and read more."},{"start":23.1,"end":23.94,"text":"Tap many words."},{"start":24.16,"end":25,"text":"It helps you learn."},{"start":25.8,"end":30.84,"text":"At the top of the page, there are three buttons: Study, Listen and Read."},{"start":31.6,"end":33.86,"text":"Study is the full lesson with check questions."},{"start":34.64,"end":37.26,"text":"In Read, you see the text in small pieces."},{"start":37.84,"end":40.34,"text":"In Listen, a voice reads the lesson to you."},{"start":40.76,"end":42.56,"text":"The words light up when you hear them."},{"start":42.68,"end":44.92,"text":"So you can listen and read at the same time."},{"start":45.62,"end":47.96,"text":"Each part also has a Play this part button."},{"start":48.8,"end":50.6,"text":"Tap it to hear only that part."},{"start":51.2,"end":52.96,"text":"You can change the help language, too."},{"start":53.5,"end":56.56,"text":"Use the English, 日本語 or Español button."},{"start":57.08,"end":59.32,"text":"After each part, there is a short question."},{"start":60.22,"end":62.4,"text":"Answer it first, then read the answer below."},{"start":63.22,"end":65.06,"text":"Some lessons also have practice games."},{"start":65.8,"end":69.8,"text":"There are six kinds of exercise:\n\nChoose: pick the right answer."},{"start":70.8,"end":72.38,"text":"Match: join the two halves."},{"start":73.16,"end":74.78,"text":"Build: make a sentence from words."},{"start":74.78,"end":77.1,"text":"Fix: find the wrong word."},{"start":77.7,"end":78.88,"text":"Type: write the answer."},{"start":79.7,"end":81.1,"text":"Transform: change a sentence."},{"start":81.66,"end":84.38,"text":"You always try first, and the answer comes after."},{"start":85.04,"end":86.22,"text":"You can stop and come back later."},{"start":86.86,"end":87.92,"text":"Your results are saved."},{"start":88.38,"end":89.58,"text":"Try the practice below now!"},{"start":90.34,"end":91.6,"text":"Do you want to remember a new word?"},{"start":92.26,"end":93.12,"text":"Open the word's window."},{"start":93.7,"end":95.58,"text":"Then choose Save to My Words."},{"start":96.1,"end":97.64,"text":"The word goes into your own list."},{"start":98.24,"end":99.56,"text":"Save only the words you need."},{"start":100.68,"end":102.24,"text":"Now go to the bottom of the lesson."},{"start":102.8,"end":104.56,"text":"There you find My cards."},{"start":105.36,"end":106.58,"text":"Your saved words are here."},{"start":106.58,"end":109,"text":"Tap Learn to study your words."},{"start":109.72,"end":111.18,"text":"Tap Test to see what you remember."},{"start":112,"end":113.92,"text":"Do this for a few minutes after each lesson."},{"start":114.54,"end":116.72,"text":"Soon the new words will be easy for you."},{"start":117.42,"end":120.68,"text":"At Ovi English, each lesson is written for one student."},{"start":121.46,"end":123.92,"text":"It starts from what you like and what you need."},{"start":124.68,"end":126.92,"text":"Do you love football, cooking or travel?"},{"start":127.86,"end":130.14,"text":"Then your lessons can be about those topics."},{"start":131.16,"end":134.32,"text":"Every lesson also includes real facts about the world."},{"start":134.7,"end":138.8,"text":"So you improve your English and discover something new at the same time."},{"start":139.48,"end":143.74,"text":"The English is written at your level, not too easy and not too difficult."},{"start":144.84,"end":146.04,"text":"Class time is for conversation."},{"start":146.8,"end":150.48,"text":"Your teacher talks with you, asks you questions and listens carefully."},{"start":151.52,"end":154.22,"text":"Now let's talk, so your teacher can learn about you."},{"start":155,"end":155.7,"text":"What is your name?"},{"start":156.34,"end":157.28,"text":"How do you spell it?"},{"start":157.88,"end":158.72,"text":"Where are you from?"},{"start":159.26,"end":160.16,"text":"Who is in your family?"},{"start":160.64,"end":162.9,"text":"What do you usually do in your free time?"},{"start":163.6,"end":164.94,"text":"What did you do last weekend?"},{"start":165.66,"end":167.52,"text":"Where are you going to go on your next holiday?"},{"start":168.6,"end":169.92,"text":"Think of two cities you know."},{"start":170.32,"end":170.98,"text":"Which one is bigger?"},{"start":172.22,"end":173.72,"text":"Have you ever been to another country?"},{"start":174.38,"end":177,"text":"If you could live in any country, where would you live?"},{"start":178.42,"end":181.22,"text":"Some people say children should learn English very young."},{"start":181.8,"end":182.36,"text":"Do you agree?"},{"start":182.86,"end":183.16,"text":"Why?"}],"words":[{"text":"This","start":0,"end":0.28},{"text":"is","start":0.28,"end":0.5},{"text":"a","start":0.5,"end":0.64},{"text":"lesson","start":0.64,"end":0.88},{"text":"page","start":0.88,"end":1.26},{"text":"It","start":1.64,"end":1.66},{"text":"has","start":1.66,"end":1.82},{"text":"a","start":1.82,"end":1.98},{"text":"lot","start":1.98,"end":2.16},{"text":"of","start":2.16,"end":2.36},{"text":"words","start":2.36,"end":2.64},{"text":"Do","start":3.18,"end":3.26},{"text":"you","start":3.26,"end":3.36},{"text":"see",